    {
        "content": "<p>cfallin opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14407\">PR #14407</a> from <code>cfallin:fix-cve</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Previously, fuel instrumentation erroneously used the cached fuel value in the caller, without writing it out to VM state before a funcref call or reloading it afterward. This would result in accumulated fuel usage during the callee's execution being lost, leading to a potential fuel amplification mechanism and thus a DoS vector.</p>\n<p>Fixes <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-m63x-6p34-q65x\">GHSA-m63x-6p34-q65x</a> (on <code>main</code>).</p>\n</blockquote>",
